<title>USA: Ambac qualified five issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>Ambac qualified five issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambac Assurance Corp. said on Tuesday it qualified for municipal bond insurance the following five issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Norfolk, Neb., $3.635 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Milltown, N.J., $3.793 million various purpose.</p>
<p>--San Juan County SD, N.M., $6.2 million school building GOs.</p>
<p>--Richland County, S.C., $5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--N.W. Austin Municipal Utility District, Texas, $1.4 million unlimited tax GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
